{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22032","headline":"有木诗八首 三 · 白居易","name":"有木诗八首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有木秋不凋，青青在江北。\n谓爲洞庭橘，美人自移植。\n上受顾盼恩，下勤浇溉力。\n实成乃是枳，臭苦不堪食。\n物有似是者，真僞何由识。\n美人默无言，对之长叹息。\n中含害物意，外矫凌霜色。\n仍向枝叶间，潜生刺如棘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}